  charged particles ( AUG. 2023)                                  1931 1451
                                                                  1931 1451
  H.I. Kim (KAERI),                                               1931 1451
  H.Y. Lee, T. Kawano, S.A. Kuvin, and M.W. Herman (LANL)         1931 1451
                                                                  1931 1451
  Energy-angular distributions of discrete and continuum levels   1931 1451
  and photon transitions related to emitted charged particles     1931 1451
  (proton, deuteron, triton, helium-3 and alpha)                  1931 1451
  have been updated [1] using CoH3 [2] and formatted into         1931 1451
  the ENDF-6 format using DeCE [3]. The Q-values have been        1931 1451
  calculated using the mass data in Audi's 2012 mass table [4]    1931 1451
  and FRDM2012 massess [5].                                       1931 1451
