  Summary of updated MF/MT                                        1931 1451
  MF=15  MT= 103, 107 were deleted.                               1931 1451
  MF=12/14  MT= 601-609, 801-809 were deleted.                    1931 1451
  MF=3  MT= 600-609, 649, 800-809, 849 were added.                1931 1451
  MF=6  MT= 600-609, 649, 800-809, 849 were added.                1931 1451
